{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣歌影視三棲天王任賢齊（小齊），將於今晚在澳洲悉尼舉行《齊跡》世界巡迴演唱會2026澳洲站。</p><p>在未正式開唱之前，任賢齊在社交平台上載一段早上在悉尼閒逛的休閒影片，更有人搶先唱起他的歌為大家熱身。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T09:23:55.121530+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T09:01:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T09:18:58.778507+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T09:18:58.778507+00:00","content_hash":"136da0c9788f05d645e62e31250ed0f67a4b18c54aff0bb1da6a56665ff36e5c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}